  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "18BBF8C142F9FD38",
      "text": "大家好啊～大家好。\\n我們開始上課吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "18BBFBC142FA0251",
      "text": "上一堂課我們\\n提到了蛋的寶貴。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "18BBFAC142FA009E",
      "text": "啊，對了，請問大家\\n有在使用寶可夢圖鑑嗎？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "18BBFDC142FA05B7",
      "text": "從蛋裡孵出來的寶可夢\\n也會好～好地被登錄在寶可夢圖鑑裡。\\r\\n大家可以放心喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "18BBFCC142FA0404",
      "text": "嘿嘿……其實啊，\\n寶可夢圖鑑App是我做的東西。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "18BBFFC142FA091D",
      "text": "雖然那是很～久以前，\\n距離我到這所學校任教有段時間……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "18BBFEC142FA076A",
      "text": "但我曾經是個研究員。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "18BBF1C142F9F153",
      "text": "那時候克拉韋爾校長\\n也還不是學校的老師，\\r\\n我們兩個都在同一個設施做研究。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "18BBF0C142F9EFA0",
      "text": "那時我們每天一起研究寶可夢，\\n好快樂啊……\\r\\n雖然我總是在挨罵。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "18B873C142F6E562",
      "text": "哎呀……？我怎麼會說起這個？\\n我不是在講圖鑑的事嗎～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "18B874C142F6E715",
      "text": "……對了，今天這堂課是要教大家\\n關於捕捉寶可夢的知識喔。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "18B871C142F6E1FC",
      "text": "正如大家所知道的，\\n如果想要捕捉寶可夢，\\r\\n首先是要削減對方的體力對吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "18B872C142F6E3AF",
      "text": "那麼，大家知不知道除了削減\\n寶可夢的體力之外，還有其他能夠\\r\\n在對戰中較容易捕捉寶可夢的技巧？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "288E982D51062E98",
      "text": "給牠樹果",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "288E9B2D510633B1",
      "text": "讓牠陷入異常狀態",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "288E9A2D510631FE",
      "text": "讓牠見識力量的差距",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "57B2167AC5FF2F01",
      "text": "哎呀呀～？那是不是\\n其他地區的方法呢～？\\c\\n在帕底亞的認知\\n有那～麼一點不同喔……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "57B2137AC5FF29E8",
      "text": "哇～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n好厲害！正確答案！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "57B2147AC5FF2B9B",
      "text": "哇喔～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的想法很狂野呢……\\c\\n派出強大的寶可夢，的確是\\n能讓對戰進行得比較有利沒錯啦。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "18B86FC142F6DE96",
      "text": "言歸正傳，讓寶可夢陷入異常狀態，\\n就會比較容易捕捉牠喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "18B870C142F6E049",
      "text": "尤其是睡眠狀態，\\n能夠讓捕獲率極～大幅地提高！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "18B86DC142F6DB30",
      "text": "只要有催眠粉、催眠術這類\\n能夠讓對方睡著的招式，\\r\\n就能登錄許多寶可夢到圖鑑裡了～！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "18B86EC142F6DCE3",
      "text": "此外，想要提升捕獲率的話，\\n也可以針對寶可夢選擇適合牠的球。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "18B87BC142F6F2FA",
      "text": "或是透過吃東西獲得捕獲力，\\n另外也可以從寶可夢的背後展開對戰。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "18B87CC142F6F4AD",
      "text": "如果在捕捉寶可夢時感到碰壁的話，\\n可以去闖道館收集道館徽章。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "18B4EDC142F3CBD9",
      "text": "提升自己能捕捉的寶可夢的等級，\\n這也是很重要的喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "18B4ECC142F3CA26",
      "text": "當寶可夢圖鑑填得差不多時，請務必！\\n拿來給吉尼亞老師我看看吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_03_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "18B4EBC142F3C873",
      "text": "今天我也教課教得很開心。\\n下一堂課會考試喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
